n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex justify-between items-center\">\n            <span className=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800\">$299</span>\n            <button className=\"px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-600 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg shadow-md hover700 focus focus2 focus500 focus75 transition duration-300 ease-in-out\">\n              Book Now\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n",
